ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi033: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a PLANE (z=0, 2x2 square); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP containing five ORIENTED_EDGEs: bottom edge (v00→v10), right edge (v10→v11), top edge (v11→v01), left edge A (v01→v00) — the main edge, left edge B (v01→v00) — a duplicate with separate EDGE_CURVE entity but geometrically identical to left edge A; two coincident EDGE_CURVEs for the left side IS the mechanism (Boolean fallout / duplicate-injection); EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND, ADVANCED_FACE, OPEN_SHELL; kernel must detect and drop the duplicate, or reject as malformed */
